//==
// # Decided splits
//
// TYPE-CATALOG.md section 5 (catalog merge, 2026-10-20): what one discretization or
// refinement step decided for one segment. KeepReason is layer 0's.
//
// Sections, in order:
//  - Splits

//==
// # Splits

// What one discretization or refinement step decided for one segment.
// Removes: the refinement that "tried nothing else" when the midpoint was too
// close (F-57 item 2): the caller matches BelowMinLength and chooses another
// site.
type SplitDecision
    = Split(At: EdgeParameter)
    | KeepBecause(Reason: KeepReason);
